    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000qznb](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000qznb) Magnitude 6.1 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Aug 10 2025 12km SW of Bigadiç. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 39.3034 longitude 28.0648. It impacted 609852 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
